    <item>
      <title>AWS CLI &amp; Permissions Setup</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/02-environment-setup/01-cli-permissions/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/02-environment-setup/01-cli-permissions/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;AWS CLI&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;AWS STS&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;AWS IAM&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-duration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;far fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Estimated duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 10 mins&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;aws-cli--permissions-setup&#34;&gt;AWS CLI &amp;amp; Permissions Setup&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1--verify-aws-cli&#34;&gt;Step 1 — Verify AWS CLI&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Open PowerShell:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;aws --version&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You should receive the installed AWS CLI version.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-callout callout-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📸 &lt;strong&gt;Screenshot placeholder — &lt;code&gt;02-01-aws-cli-version.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Capture the PowerShell window showing a successful &lt;code&gt;aws --version&lt;/code&gt; command.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Replace this block with the real screenshot after completing the step.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-2--verify-the-workshop-identity&#34;&gt;Step 2 — Verify the workshop identity&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Use your configured profile:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Quick Sight Account Onboarding</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/02-environment-setup/02-quicksight-onboarding/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/02-environment-setup/02-quicksight-onboarding/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Amazon Quick&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Amazon Quick Sight&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;SPICE&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-duration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;far fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Estimated duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 10 mins&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;quick-sight-account-onboarding&#34;&gt;Quick Sight Account Onboarding&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Amazon Quick Sight is the BI capability used by CUDOS. It is part of Amazon Quick.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1--open-amazon-quick&#34;&gt;Step 1 — Open Amazon Quick&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In the AWS Management Console:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Confirm the Region is &lt;strong&gt;Asia Pacific (Sydney)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Search for &lt;strong&gt;Amazon Quick&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Open the service.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-callout callout-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📸 &lt;strong&gt;Screenshot placeholder — &lt;code&gt;02-04-amazon-quick-home.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Capture the Amazon Quick landing or sign-up screen in the Sydney Region.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
